    "text": "Zachary\nFive Arrested, 28 Dogs Euthanized After Dog Fighting Ring Uncovered in Zachary Louisiana\nBy Joe Cunningham,\n8 hours agoFive people face felony charges, including dog fighting, drug possession, money laundering, and firearm violations. 28 of 30 seized dogs were euthanized; the remaining 2 dogs may be placed in new homes. The operation spanned multiple cities in the Baton Rouge area, involving two related families. Evidence included treadmills, steroids,...\n1",
